<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 142.1 mln rand S.African bonds Friday.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 142.1 mln rand S.African bonds Friday.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of 142.07 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Friday after selling 13.40 million rand's worth on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
